- **Domain Utama Target:** https://www.vijeboutiqueresort.com / https://hotel.hasanarofid.site
- **Branch Utama:** `main` / `master`
- **Repository Git:** `git@github.com:hasanarofid/sistem-hotel.git`
- **Lisensi & Owner:** [@hasanarofid.site](https://hasanarofid.site) | WhatsApp: [Wa.me/628814959247](https://Wa.me/628814959247)

---

## 1. Peran, Identitas & Prinsip Utama AI Redesign

- **Peran AI:** Senior UI/UX Designer, Luxury Hospitality Website Specialist, dan Senior Full-Stack Developer.
- **Tugas Utama:** Rebuild & Redesign Vije Boutique Resort menjadi end-to-end Hotel Website & Booking Management System dengan fokus Luxury Boutique Resort / Quiet Luxury dan direct booking channel.
- **Prinsip Utama (Final Design Principle):**
  > **"Less, but better."**  
  > Website harus memberikan kesan instan saat pertama dibuka: *"Ini resort luxury boutique premium"* — bukan *"Ini website template hotel generik"*.
  > Prioritas Hierarki: **Photography > Typography > Whitespace > Storytelling > CTA**.

---

## 2. Arsitektur Teknis & Modul PRD

### Tech Stack Standard:
- **Frontend:** Next.js / Vue 3 (Inertia.js), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Framer Motion.
- **Backend:** Laravel REST API (PHP 8.2+), Laravel Sanctum / JWT.
- **Database:** PostgreSQL / MySQL (ERD terstruktur), Redis (Queue/Cache).
- **Storage & Email:** S3-compatible / local storage, SMTP / transactional email, WA Gateway Engine.
- **Payment Abstraction:** `PaymentGatewayInterface` (Midtrans & Xendit).

### Modul Kunci PRD:
1. Public Website & Editorial Landing Page
2. Room & Accommodation Management
3. Direct Online Booking Engine
4. Guest & CRM Management
5. Booking Management & Calendar
6. Payment Gateway Abstraction & Webhooks
7. Admin Dashboard & Content Management System (CMS)
8. Gallery & Hotel Facility Management
9. Promo / Discount / Voucher Engine
10. Reporting, Financial Overview & Audit Log
11. User & Role Management (RBAC)
12. Notification System (Automated E-Voucher WhatsApp & Email PDF)

---

## 3. Aturan Bisnis & Concurrency (Key Business Rules)

- **Kalkulasi Server-Side:** Seluruh hitungan harga, ketersediaan, promo, service charge, dan pajak dilakukan di backend.
- **Double Booking Prevention:** Gunakan `DB::transaction()` dan locking atomic (`lockForUpdate()`) saat membuat reservasi.
- **Verifikasi Webhook Payment:** Booking dikonfirmasi hanya jika signature webhook payment gateway valid atau via verifikasi admin manual.
- **Audit Log Mandatory:** Setiap transaksi, perubahan kuota kamar, dan aksi admin wajib masuk ke Audit Log.
- **RBAC Boundaries:** Enforce role boundaries (`Super Admin`, `Admin`, `Reservation Staff`, `Finance`, `Content Manager`).

---

## 4. Referensi Desain & Brand Direction

### Referensi Visual Standard:
- **Aman Resorts:** Minimal luxury, strong photography, calm atmosphere, nature connection, editorial typography, immersive storytelling.
- **Kempinski Hotels:** European luxury, elegant typography, premium hospitality, sophisticated layout, strong brand presence.

### Color Palette (Natural & Luxury)
- **Primary:** Warm Ivory (`#FAF8F5`), Cream (`#F4EFE6`), Sand (`#E6DEC9`), Warm Beige (`#D9CEB2`).
- **Secondary:** Deep Forest Green (`#1C2826`), Dark Olive (`#2B3023`), Charcoal (`#1A1A1A`).
- **Accent:** Muted Gold / Bronze (`#C5A059`).
- **Background:** Off White / Ivory (`#FDFBF7`) / Obsidian (`#121212` for dark sections).
- **Text:** Deep Charcoal (`#222222`).

### Typography Standard
- **Display / Heading:** Elegant Serif (`Cormorant Garamond` / `Playfair Display` / `Cinzel`).
- **Body / Subtitle:** Clean Modern Sans-Serif (`Plus Jakarta Sans` / `Inter` / `Manrope`).

---

## 5. Standar UX, Animasi, Performa & SEO

- **Subtle Luxury Animation:** Durasi transisi 400ms – 1000ms (Fade-up, image reveal, slow parallax, smooth hover). Dilarang bounce atau efek flashing cepat.
- **Performa & Mobile-First:** WebP/AVIF, lazy loading, LCP hero optimization, Core Web Vitals tinggi.
- **SEO:** Hotel/LocalBusiness Schema.org Structured Data, semantic HTML.

---

## 6. Prosedur Git & Deploy

1. Build frontend assets: `npm run build`
2. Push commit:
   ```bash
   git add .
   git commit -m "feat/redesign: update luxury boutique resort rules & architecture from PRD"
   git push origin master
   ```
